# Rust build artifacts
wallet-core/target/
# wasm-pack's standalone build output - regenerated by `npm run build:wasm`
# in app/, which is how the app itself consumes wallet-core. Kept out of
# git so a compiled WASM binary is never committed; anyone building the
# app regenerates it from source.
